Question 7)Find the intersection point of ll


BruteForce Approach : Using HashMap
code:public class Solution {
    public ListNode getIntersectionNode(ListNode headA, ListNode headB) {
        ListNode tempA = headA;
        ListNode tempB = headB;
        HashMap<ListNode, Integer> map = new HashMap<>();
        while(tempA!=null)
        {
            map.put(tempA,map.getOrDefault(tempA,0)+1);
            tempA = tempA.next;
        }
        while(tempB!=null)
        {
            if(map.containsKey(tempB))
            {
                return tempB;
            }
            tempB=tempB.next;
        }
        return null;
    }
}

T.C. = O(N1 + N2) average case (Java HashMap operations = O(1) average).
N1 and N2 simply refer to:

✔ N1 = Length of Linked List A
✔ N2 = Length of Linked List B

S.C: O(N1) , because we are storing first liked list 

