Question 8) Detect a loop in LL


Brute Force Approach : koi linkedlist mein cycle hai ye pata chalega aise ki : jab traverse karte hue hum dobara usi linkedlist pe pahuch jayenge, so we will use HashMap to see whether this particular linkedlist is arrive earlier or not

code: public class Solution {
    public boolean hasCycle(ListNode head) {
        if(head==null || head.next==null) return false;
        HashMap<ListNode,Integer> map = new HashMap<>();
        ListNode temp = head;
        while(temp!=null)
        {
            if(map.containsKey(temp))
            {
                return true;
            }
            map.put(temp,map.getOrDefault(temp,0)+1);
            temp = temp.next;
        }
        return false;
    }
}

T.C. -> O(N*2*logN) traversal*depending on your map takes
S.C. -> O(N) for storing all the nodes

Optimal Approach: using Tortoise and Hare Algorithm , slow -> 1x , fast -> 2x 

